<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#10091c">
  <title>Terms of Use · Stratic Market</title>
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{background:#f7f5f1}body{margin:0;color:#292332;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
    .terms-page{width:min(900px,100%);margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(18px,4vw,42px) clamp(16px,4vw,28px) 56px}
    .terms-hero{border:1px solid #634b76;border-bottom:4px solid #e9bd58;border-radius:22px;padding:clamp(24px,5vw,44px);background:radial-gradient(circle at 88% 5%,#684078 0,transparent 36%),linear-gradient(135deg,#10091c,#241238 62%,#451d39);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 14px 36px #21133320}
    .terms-kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;font-weight:800;color:#ffe4a0}.terms-hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,6vw,44px);line-height:1.12;color:#ffe7ad;margin:12px 0}.terms-hero p{color:#e4d9eb;line-height:1.75;margin:0}
    .terms-card{margin-top:18px;padding:clamp(20px,4vw,36px);border:1px solid #eadfce;border-radius:20px;background:#fffefa;box-shadow:0 10px 28px #2412380b}
    .terms-card h2{font-size:19px;color:#39234c;margin:0 0 12px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eadfce}.terms-card h3{font-size:15px;color:#39234c;margin:22px 0 6px}.terms-card p,.terms-card li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#51495a}.terms-card p{margin:12px 0}.terms-card ul{padding-left:22px}.terms-note{margin-top:20px;padding:13px 15px;border-left:4px solid #c68d21;border-radius:10px;background:#fff5df;color:#5c4b2d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="terms-page">
    <header class="terms-hero"><div class="terms-kicker">STRATIC MARKET · USER AGREEMENT</div><h1>Terms of Use</h1><p>These terms explain the rules for using Stratic Market as a customer or seller. Please read them before using the platform.</p></header>
    <article class="terms-card">
      <h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>
      <h3>1. Using Stratic Market</h3>
      <p>By accessing or using Stratic Market, you agree to use the service lawfully, honestly and respectfully. You must provide accurate information and keep your account details secure. You are responsible for activity carried out through your account.</p>
      <h3>2. Seller responsibilities</h3>
      <p>Sellers must have the legal right to offer the products they list. Product descriptions, photographs, prices, availability, payment details and delivery information must be truthful and kept up to date. Sellers are responsible for responding to customers and honouring orders they have accepted. A seller must use only a payment QR code or payment method that belongs to, or is authorised by, that seller.</p>
      <h3>3. Customer responsibilities</h3>
      <p>Customers should review the product description, seller information, final price, payment method and delivery arrangements before ordering. Customers should communicate respectfully and never share passwords, one-time passcodes, bank PINs or recovery codes in chat.</p>
      <h3>4. Orders, payments and delivery</h3>
      <p>Unless the application clearly confirms a specific service, Stratic Market is a platform that helps customers discover products and contact independent sellers. It does not automatically guarantee product quality, stock availability, seller performance, refunds, a delivery date or a courier booking. A parcel request is not a confirmed shipment until the delivery provider accepts it and issues the relevant confirmation or tracking details. Sellers and customers must clearly agree on applicable prices, taxes, shipping charges, payment, cancellation, return and warranty arrangements before completing a transaction.</p>
      <h3>5. Prohibited use</h3>
      <p>You must not list unlawful, counterfeit, stolen, misleading, dangerous or prohibited goods; post content that violates another person's rights; misuse personal information; impersonate another person; manipulate reviews or orders; attempt unauthorised access; disrupt the service; or use Stratic Market for fraud, harassment or any unlawful purpose.</p>
      <h3>6. Platform availability and account action</h3>
      <p>We work to keep Stratic Market available, but uninterrupted or error-free operation cannot be guaranteed. Features may be changed, maintained or temporarily unavailable. We may restrict or suspend access where reasonably necessary to address suspected fraud, security risks, unlawful activity or a breach of these terms.</p>
      <h3>7. Responsibility and legal rights</h3>
      <p>Users are responsible for the agreements they make directly with one another. Nothing in these terms excludes a consumer right or legal protection that cannot lawfully be excluded. To the extent permitted by applicable law, Stratic Market is not responsible for a seller's independent conduct, inaccurate listing supplied by a user, or a delivery provider's service outside the platform's control.</p>
      <h3>8. Privacy and updates</h3>
      <p>Your use of the service is also subject to the Privacy Policy available within Stratic Market. We may update these terms as the service or applicable requirements change. The latest version published on this page applies from its stated update date. If any part is held unenforceable, the remaining terms continue to apply to the extent permitted by law.</p>
      <div class="terms-note">Last updated: 30 October 2026. These terms are a general platform notice, not legal advice. They should be reviewed by a qualified lawyer for the regions where Stratic Market operates.</div>
    </article>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
